# The response cache is committed on purpose. The judging requirement is a
# public demo that works with zero setup, and the submission checklist asks for
# the cache fallback to be verified with networking disabled. Committing it also
# pins the demo to the same forecast the quoted results were measured against,
# so the deployed app and docs/headline.md cannot drift apart.
#
# The credit ledger is local accounting, not part of the demo.
data/cache/credit_ledger.jsonl
